# Authorization Rules

Role != subscription != entitlement.

A user may be authenticated and still have no subscription (`currentPlan = null`).
That is distinct from being subscribed to Basic.

Use capability checks such as:
- can(user, permission)
- requirePermission(user, permission)
- requireEntitlement(user, entitlement)

`control_panel.access` requires a stored subscription.
Plan-specific feature flags (AgriExpert, AgriAcademy, AgriProduct, …) stay separate.

Never hardcode subscription names inside UI/business logic.
Never treat a missing plan as Basic.
Server-side authorization is mandatory.
UI permission checks only control presentation.
